pan>: Well, I'm really not feeling well.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Stevens</span>: What are your symptoms?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I have a stomach ache, headache, sore throat and a runny nose.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "11100", "image": "engenn4le03ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Stevens</span>: I see. Do you have a cough?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: No. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Stevens</span>: An earache?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: No. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Stevens</span>: Ok. It sounds like you have the flu.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I think I have a slight fever.", "id": 3, "time": "22400", "image": "engenn4le03ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Stevens</span>: Open your mouth. I want to take your temperature. Hm, 37.5 degrees - a little high. You must take this medicine, twice a day. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I have to?! Yes, Doctor.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Stevens</span>: You should also get some rest.", "id": 4, "time": "37000", "image": "engenn4le03ob02re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Could I have a sick note, please?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Stevens</span>: Sure. Here you are. Don't forget to take the medicine twice a day.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yes, Doctor. Thank you.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Dr. Stevens</span>: You're welcome. Take care.", "id": 5, "time": "56000", "image": "engenn4le03ob02re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le03ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le03ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 3, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn4le03ob02re3aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le03ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}